\f0\fs24 \cf0 \CocoaLigature0 Welcome to NV!\
\
This is the body of a note. Your notes can be as long or as short as you want.\
\
Each note is a plain text file in your notes folder, which you can change in Settings \uc0\u8250  Notes. You can also add, edit, rename or delete notes in Finder or any other app, and NV picks up the change.\
\
Write in Markdown and press \uc0\u8963 \u8984 P to see the preview.\
\
Create links between notes: [[How does this thing work?]].\
\
You can create as many notes as you want\uc0\u8212 NV can hold thousands of them and works best when content is distributed.\
\
Every keyboard shortcut is listed in [[Excruciatingly Useful Shortcuts]] and in Help \uc0\u8250  Keyboard Shortcuts.\
\

\i These notes were included to get you started with NV. You may delete them at any time.}